# @subtitle: Solve 3D P2 membrane stress on a spherical containment shell, paired with the 2D analytic biharmonic streamfunction workbench quantifying 8-vortex quadrupolar parasitic capillary currents (Ca_max) across five discrete surface-curvature approximations (Voxel CSF, Kernel CSF, Parabolic Monge MLS, Height-Function, and Pratt Quadric MLS).
# @verification_badge: Verified by V65 · 5-Scheme Curvature Error & 8-Eddy Parasitic Current Hierarchy · Ca_Pratt = 6.35×10⁻¹⁰ (> 2×10⁵× Suppression)
# @doc_path: docs/analytic-tests/A20-spurious-capillary-eddies-geometry-error.md
