# ---
# @check: 1. Unsmoothed Voxel / Staircase CSF (Brackbill et al. 1992) || κ_h = −∇_Δx · (∇c / ‖∇c‖),   σ*_κ ~ O(1) non-convergent || Ca_exact = 0 (u ≡ 0) || Ca_max = 1.687×10⁻¹ (U_max = 2.50 m/s) || Order p = 0.06 || Fails (O(1) Eddies)
# @check: 2. Kernel-Smoothed Color-Gradient CSF (Morris 2000) || κ_i = −∑ V_j (ñ_j − ñ_i)·∇W_ij,   σ*_κ ~ O(Δx/D) || Ca_exact = 0 (u ≡ 0) || Ca_max = 1.839×10⁻² (U_max = 0.272 m/s) || Order p = 1.00 || 1st-Order Eddies
# @check: 3. Standard Parabolic Taylor Monge MLS (2nd-Order Basis) || z ≈ a u² + b u v + c v² (truncates −r⁴ / 8R₀³) || Ca_exact = 0 (u ≡ 0) || Ca_max = 1.329×10⁻⁴ (U_max = 1.97 mm/s) || Order p = 2.12 || 2nd-Order Eddies
# @check: 4. Balanced-Force Height-Function VOF (Popinet 2009 Gerris) || κ_HF = −∇·(∇H / √(1+|∇H|²)),   ∇_h p = γ κ_h ∇_h c || Ca_exact = 0 (u ≡ 0) || Ca_max = 1.914×10⁻⁵ (U_max = 0.283 mm/s) || Order p = 2.00 || ≤ 10⁻⁴ (PASS)
# @check: 5. Fieldsmith Spherical-Exact Pratt Quadric MLS + Analytic SDF || z = c₁(u²+½z²) + c₂uv + c₃(v²+½z²) + c₄u + c₅v || Ca_exact = 0 (u ≡ 0) || Ca_max = 6.35×10⁻¹⁰ (U_max = 9.39 nm/s) || Exact on Sphere || ≤ 10⁻⁷ (PASS)
